# omarchy-repo.packages - packages from Omarchy's own pacman repo.
#
# IMPORTANT: https://pkgs.omarchy.org ships 200+ packages for x86_64 but only
# `omarchy-keyring` for aarch64. Everything below is therefore installed ONLY
# on x86_64. On aarch64 these are skipped and equivalents from base/apps/
# desktop tiers are used instead (see docs/08-arm64.md).
#
# Verified against https://pkgs.omarchy.org/x86_64/omarchy.db

# --- Omarchy's Neovim distribution ---
omarchy-nvim

# --- launcher stack (replaces wofi) ---
walker
elephant
elephant-desktopapplications
elephant-calc
elephant-clipboard
elephant-files
elephant-runner
elephant-symbols
elephant-websearch

# --- Omarchy first-party GUI/TUI apps ---
omacalc
omacut
omawrite
cliamp

# --- AUR helper ---
yay
